Z||000006||StuGood||08-20-2001||01:33 PM||||Delano is just the old name for the near west side (near the river).  Where the poor folks (like me  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">) live.  Thanks for the upholsterer recommendations.<P>From the birth dates in the "Zodiac signs of Fiero owners" thread, I was graduated from high school about 6 months before you were born.  <P>BTW, if you want to see some awesome classic cars, go over to the Spangles at Pawnee and Seneca on a saturday evening.  It gets better every week!<P>Anyway, all this chit-chat probably belongs in the Off-Topic forum, or e-mail.  Take Care!||||reg||1
